gptcli for Debian

This package ships install-time artifacts for the aiagent execution boundary:

- system user: aiagent
- group: gptcli-share
- /home/aiagent/shared (setgid) workspace root
- sudoers wrapper for running a hardened command as aiagent

User enrollment

Add your user to the gptcli-share group and re-login:

  sudo usermod -a -G gptcli-share <username>

Go toolchain

This repository uses a Go toolchain directive (go1.24.12) in go.mod.
If your distro's golang-go is older than the required version, you can install
a newer Go from https://go.dev/dl/ (or use a compatible backport), then rebuild.
